---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Line from '../components/blocks/Line.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Shape from '../components/blocks/Shape.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import img26a87618a from '../assets/images/2-6a87618a.png';
import img26 from '../assets/images/26.png';
import img39 from '../assets/images/39.png';
import img58 from '../assets/images/58.png';
import img59 from '../assets/images/59.png';
import gradient3 from '../assets/images/gradient-3.png';
import ivory from '../assets/images/ivory.png';
import jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios48 from '../assets/images/jphelloseoheadshots0626-staborstudios-48.jpg';
import kaboompicsBusinesswomanHasAConversationO from '../assets/images/kaboompics-businesswoman-has-a-conversation-on-the-phone-25754.jpg';
import pattern4 from '../assets/images/pattern-4.png';
import pexelsArinaKrasnikova6016372 from '../assets/images/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6016372.jpg';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
import unsplashImageEauzPmpyg8 from '../assets/images/unsplash-image-eauz-pmpyg8.jpg';
import unsplashImageWy5kue0r4K from '../assets/images/unsplash-image-wy5kue0r4-k.jpg';
---

<Layout title="Foundational SEO and AEO for Therapists | HelloSEO" description="Explore professional SEO and AEO services to improve your website rankings through ongoing optimization, digital PR, paid ads, and strategic support." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} footerOffset="2vw" headerTheme="white">
  <Section theme="white" bg={{ src: pattern4, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [20, 20], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="2/2/17/10" d="5/6/14/22" z={2} align="center">
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>DONE-FOR-YOU SEO &amp; AEO</strong></p>
      <h2 class="ta-center">When your days are spent pouring into people, running a practice, and carrying the weight of the work, <span class="c-lightAccent">making time for marketing</span> can’t always be a priority. </h2>
      <p class="large ta-center">We’ll make sure your website works for you while you get to work helping others. </p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="18/2/20/10" d="15/11/17/17" z={5} align="center" href="/contact">Get Started</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section height="small" grid={{ rows: [25, 18], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="1/2/13/10" d="1/16/19/25" z={1} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ r: 4 }, {  }] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={unsplashImageEauzPmpyg8} alt="A woman with glasses and shoulder-length hair sitting in a chair, writing in a notebook, with another person with red hair in the foreground." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 38vw" />
    <Text m="14/2/23/10" d="2/3/16/14" z={2} align="center">
      <h2>a marketing investment you <span class="c-lightAccent">can measure</span>.</h2>
      <p>SEO, and much of marketing, has a reputation for smoke and mirrors. Instead of adding to the confusion, we pull back the curtain completely so you know exactly how your investment leads to the growth of your practice, without the sales jargon or vanity stats.</p>
      <h3><span class="c-darkAccent"><em>Data transparency is non-negotiable.&nbsp;</em></span></h3>
      <p>Expect organized reporting on the metrics that matter, like turning search into booked clients, delivered in succinct videos and 1:1 sessions. Whether you want to chat through tons of tech questions or prefer to follow the data from a distance, <strong>you’ll always know what we’re doing, why it matters, and how it’s paying off.</strong></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="24/2/26/10" d="16/3/18/8" z={3} align="center" href="/contact">Get Started</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section height="small" grid={{ rows: [68, 36], rowGap: 3, colGap: 35 }}>
    <Text m="2/2/9/10" d="1/6/5/22" z={1}>
      <h2 class="ta-center">Designed for practice owners and solo therapists who want a <span class="c-lightAccent">consistent</span> caseload. </h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="9/2/13/10" d="5/6/7/22" z={2} align="center">
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-black">With our ongoing search support package, you get the following every month:</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="14/2/21/10" d="9/14/13/25" z={4} align="center">
      <h4><span class="c-black">On-Page SEO</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-black">Keyword research, optimized titles/meta descriptions, copy aligned with search intent, and Google Business Profile optimization.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Line m="21/2/22/10" d="13/14/14/25" z={11} zm={12} align="center" />
    <Text m="22/2/28/10" d="14/14/18/25" z={5} zm={6} align="center">
      <h4><span class="c-black">Technical SEO</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-black">Full technical audits and fixes, sitemap and schema setup, and Core Web Vitals monitoring.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Line m="28/2/29/10" d="18/14/19/25" z={12} zm={13} align="center" />
    <Text m="29/2/35/10" d="19/14/23/25" z={7} zm={8} align="center">
      <h4><span class="c-black">AEO</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-black">Schema optimization for AI previews, plus prompt tracking and AI visibility insights.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Line m="35/2/36/10" d="23/14/24/25" z={13} zm={14} align="center" />
    <Text m="36/2/42/10" d="24/14/28/25" z={9} zm={10} align="center">
      <h4><span class="c-black">Tracking &amp; Monthly Insights</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-black">Full analytics setup with ongoing tracking of traffic, keyword movement, AI visibility, and leads, so you always know what's working.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Line m="42/2/43/10" d="28/14/29/25" z={14} zm={15} align="center" />
    <Text m="44/2/53/10" d="29/14/35/25" z={10} zm={11} align="center">
      <h4><span class="c-black">Direct Access to Our Founder</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-black">You'll work directly with Jade and her team between reports for quick questions, feedback, or SEO advice whenever you need it. Because we're small and nimble, your strategy stays current with the latest Google and AI search changes, not last year's playbook.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Img m="55/2/68/10" d="8/2/23/13" z={3} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsArinaKrasnikova6016372} alt="A young woman with wavy brown hair seated at a wooden table working on a laptop, with a notebook and cup in front of her, in a cozy room with wooden furniture and a white wall." focal="51.2% 87.2%" radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 46vw" />
  </Section>

  <Section theme="bright" grid={{ rows: [31, 15], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="1/1/14/11" d="1/1/16/12" z={2} align="center" src={img39} alt="Two women having a conversation in a bright living room, with a large plant and a window in the background." focal="71.6% 37.6%" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 46vw" />
    <Text m="15/2/17/10" d="3/14/5/25" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2>Ideal If You Are:</h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="17/2/28/10" d="5/14/12/25" z={4} align="center" alignM="start" bulletIcon={img26a87618a}>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>Ready to hand off your SEO and AEO so you can focus on your clients and employees, not your website</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Growing your practice and wanting a marketing partner that scales with you</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Seeing some traffic and inquiries, and ready to build on that momentum&nbsp;</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Looking for a long-term expert relationship, not a one-time fix</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Wanting your strategy to keep pace with Google and AI search changes automatically</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
    <Button m="28/2/30/10" d="12/14/14/20" z={6} align="center" href="/contact">GET STARTED</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" height="small" grid={{ rows: [17, 9], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Shape m="3/2/17/10" d="2/3/10/25" z={1} align="center" fill="var(--darkAccent)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--accent)', width: '15px' }} radius="30px" />
    <Img m="1/2/4/10" d="4/23/8/26" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 4, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }], alternate: true, iterations: 1 }] }} src={ivory} alt="A smiling cat's face with closed eyes on a light-colored background." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 13vw" />
    <Text m="5/3/16/9" d="3/5/9/21" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-white">“HelloSEO was so helpful with my business visibility. </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">They understands my industry and are passionate about getting great results. Jade was dedicated to making small tweaks and changes until we got the results we were looking for. She was transparent with me along the way and I felt truly supported.”</span></p>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white"><strong>- PAULA F.</strong></span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="medium" grid={{ rows: [79, 36], rowGap: 11, colGap: 15 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/3/10" d="1/10/3/18" z={1}>
      <h2 class="ta-center">How It Works</h2>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="3/2/17/10" d="4/6/10/24" z={3} zm={2} align="center" origin="0% 50%" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="3/2/9/10" d="4/4/10/9" z={13} align="center" src={kaboompicsBusinesswomanHasAConversationO} alt="A woman with wavy brown hair wearing a beige blazer and brown wide-leg pants, standing in front of white curtains, holding a textured coffee mug and talking on her cellphone, with a black chair and a laptop on a table next to her." focal="57.2% 20%" radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="10/3/16/9" d="4/10/10/23" z={4} zm={3} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-white">Schedule a Call:</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">We’ll spend your discovery call talking all about your practice, your goals, and what a successful partnership looks like to you. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="17/2/33/10" d="10/4/16/20" z={5} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--black)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="17/2/23/10" d="10/19/16/24" z={14} align="center" src={img59} alt="Cozy workspace with a wooden table featuring a laptop, a cup of coffee on a saucer, an open notebook, and a pen. The table is near a window with a metal grid, letting in natural light, with soft pillows on the window seat and a few shelves on the wall." focal="50% 84.8%" radius="0px 10px 10px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="24/3/31/9" d="10/5/16/18" z={5} zm={6} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-white">Receive a Plan Built Around You: </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">We don’t have a one-size-fits-all SEO template. Expect a tailored plan designed to reach your goals and a strategy that fits your practice. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="33/2/48/10" d="16/8/22/24" z={5} zm={7} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--mauve)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="33/2/39/10" d="16/4/22/9" z={15} zm={16} align="center" src={jphelloseoheadshots0626Staborstudios48} alt="A woman with shoulder-length brown hair, wearing a dark green button-up shirt, gold necklace, and red lipstick, sitting on a brown leather chair in front of brown curtains, smiling at the camera." focal="69.2% 29.6%" radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="40/3/47/9" d="16/10/22/23" z={6} zm={8} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-white">Experience the Results:  </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Once you’re in, we handle the on-page, technical, and AI search optimization every month. We’ll be working in the background so you can prioritize supporting your practice and clients.  </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="48/2/63/10" d="22/4/28/20" z={6} zm={9} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--accent)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="48/2/54/10" d="22/19/28/24" z={15} align="center" src={img26} alt="Woman sitting on a gray sofa, writing on a tablet with a stylus, with coffee cups and pastries on a table nearby, in a room with a potted plant and a wooden door." radius="0px 10px 10px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="55/3/62/9" d="22/5/28/18" z={6} zm={10} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-black">Stay in the Loop: </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-black">You’ll get monthly insights on traffic, keywords, AI visibility, organic leads, and more. Plus, you have direct access to Jade anytime a question pops up between reports. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="63/2/76/10" d="28/8/34/24" z={4} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--darkAccent)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="63/2/69/10" d="28/4/34/9" z={16} zm={17} align="center" src={img58} alt="A man sitting on a beige couch in a room with wooden-paneled walls and a green plant in the corner, smiling and looking to the side." focal="57.2% 29.6%" radius="10px 0px 0px 10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="70/3/75/9" d="28/10/34/23" z={7} zm={11} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-white">Evolve as You Grow: </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">We don’t believe SEO is static, so as your practice grows, so will your strategy. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="77/3/79/9" d="35/11/37/17" z={11} zm={12} align="center" href="/contact">Get Started</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" inset grid={{ rows: [17, 9], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Shape m="3/2/17/10" d="2/3/10/25" z={2} zm={1} align="center" fill="var(--mauve)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--accent)', width: '15px' }} radius="30px" />
    <Img m="1/2/4/10" d="1/12/4/16" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 4, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }], alternate: true, iterations: 1 }] }} src={gradient3} alt="Smiling cartoon cat with closed eyes, whiskers, and a curled tail." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="5/3/15/9" d="4/7/9/21" z={2} align="center">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">“Working with HelloSEO was a great experience. </span></h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">They improved our search rankings, boosted organic traffic, and helped more customers find and book with us. We felt supported every step of the way and saw real results.”</span></p>
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-white"><strong>- BECKY G.</strong></span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" height="small" inset divider={{ height: '2vw', concave: true }} grid={{ rows: [16, 13], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/16/10" d="1/2/13/26" z={1} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #d34320', radius: '34px' }} src={unsplashImageWy5kue0r4K} alt="Three people sitting in a circle in a modern office space near large windows with blinds. One woman is facing a woman with pale hair, and a man is sitting next to the woman with pale hair. There are tables and chairs, a laptop, and personal items like a notebook and sunglasses on the table." focal="53.2% 82.4%" radius="30px" overlay={{ opacity: 1, color: 'hsl(var(--black-hsl) / 0.65)' }} parallax={{ intensity: 20, rotation: 45, zoomStart: 2 }} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw" />
    <Text m="4/3/12/9" d="4/7/8/21" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">We fiercely believe in the work you do. </span></h2>
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-white">When you’re ready, we’re here to help you scale impact by reaching more ideal clients.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="12/3/14/9" d="9/10/11/18" z={3} align="center" href="/results">Explore Our Results</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
